  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Humanitarian Safety III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INSO is submitting a 45-month project with a requested budget of 5.000.000 EUR from the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands for the project titled &apos;Supporting Humanitarian Safety III&apos; under Policy Objective 1 of the programme grant &apos;Strengthening the Humanitarian Sector 2024-2027&apos;: More effective application of humanitarian principles and international humanitarian law, enabling more humanitarian responders to do their work safely and access populations in need. To contribute to this policy objective, INSO will i) provide access to adaptive NGO safety and access platforms via field-based, remote and mobile interventions, ii) establish a common operating picture by expanding the Conflict and Humanitarian Data Centre&apos;s coverage and its application, iii) develop operational advocacy, research and coordination.</narrative>
  </description>
